.env
.env.dutchie
.env.local
# This context ("." for web/pos-web/migrate/warmer/celery) also contains voice/. A bare ".env" only
# matches the ROOT file, so voice/.env (Vapi key, voice SECRET_KEY, HHT_BACKEND_TOKEN, DB password)
# and voice/secrets/*.json (Vertex service account) were COPY'd into every budtender image layer.
# Secrets reach containers through env_file / read-only mounts at run time, never the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
voice/secrets/
voice/data/uploads/
data/creds/
**/*-sa.json
**/sa-key.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*gcp*.json
stores.json
stores.local.json
**/stores.json
**/stores.local.json
.git
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
**/.venv/
staticfiles/
*.sqlite3
README.md
